{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE PARTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home to abandoned buildings, bowling alleys stuck in time, and overflowing thrift stores downtown, Pine Hill is a quiet Midwestern college town. Quiet enough that nobody seemed to hear Ginny Nicholson die. The fine arts students at Pine Grove University felt it the most, but, to you, that isn't enough. You want to know why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Halloween party turned night of awkward conversation and mournful drinking, Alex searches for answers in the memories of Ginny's friends, unraveling things about themselves, their hometown, and Ginny that they never knew. A Week Before Autumn is an interactive narrative game that explores the nuances of the connections we have, the beauty in the little things, and rediscovering the place you call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/986265e414cc3f602f15f08dbb3c4b3a.avif?t=1774466727\" width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIT AND STAY A WHILE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cast of 15 characters, explore visual novel-like gameplay with the ability to explore the town of Pine Hill.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in minigames from bowling to taking photos to fighting with foam swords.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore thousands of dialogue options and 50+ scenes with locals, coworkers, and roommates all around Pine Hill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/4606b86e8799e544664540640b5198e4.poster.avif?t=1774466727\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/4606b86e8799e544664540640b5198e4.webm?t=1774466727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882060?t=1774466727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/6820da30ac9494498f75e471a5f5c1ce3b6236c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774466727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/2dcbbaa48f3f6a5a910bd82f568d83e9d4dcb57d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774466727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/2dcbbaa48f3f6a5a910bd82f568d83e9d4dcb57d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774466727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains language, depictions of violence and self harm/suicide."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE PARTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home to abandoned buildings, bowling alleys stuck in time, and overflowing thrift stores downtown, Pine Hill is a quiet Midwestern college town. Quiet enough that nobody seemed to hear Ginny Nicholson die. The fine arts students at Pine Grove University felt it the most, but, to you, that isn't enough. You want to know why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Halloween party turned night of awkward conversation and mournful drinking, Alex searches for answers in the memories of Ginny's friends, unraveling things about themselves, their hometown, and Ginny that they never knew. A Week Before Autumn is an interactive narrative game that explores the nuances of the connections we have, the beauty in the little things, and rediscovering the p